# 🚲 Bike Sales Analysis – Excel

## 📌 Overview

This project analyzes bike sales data using Microsoft Excel to understand sales performance, customer behavior, and purchasing patterns.

The analysis focuses on transforming raw sales data into meaningful insights through data cleaning, analysis, and interactive reporting.

## 🎯 Objectives

- Analyze overall sales performance
- Identify sales trends and patterns
- Understand customer purchasing behavior
- Analyze sales by customer and product attributes
- Create an interactive dashboard for reporting

## 🛠️ Tools & Skills

- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning & Preparation
- Excel Formulas
- Pivot Tables
- Pivot Charts
- Data Visualization
- Dashboard Development
- Exploratory Data Analysis

## 📊 Analysis

The project includes analysis of:

- Sales performance
- Customer demographics
- Product categories
- Purchasing patterns
- Revenue and order trends

## 📈 Dashboard

An Excel dashboard was created to present key metrics and analysis in an easy-to-understand format.

## 📁 Project Files

- Bike_Sales_Analysis.xlsx – Final Excel analysis and dashboard
- Bike_Sales_Dataset.xlsx – Source dataset
- Dashboard_Preview.png – Dashboard preview

## 💡 Key Takeaway

The project demonstrates how Excel can be used to clean, analyze, and visualize business data to support data-driven decision-making.
